; error: 12:7: 'P.inc' changes the value it is called on, so it needs a place that can change, and a tuple's items never change; give the whole tuple a new value instead, as in 't = (1, 2)'
shape P
    n: int

    alters inc()
        .n = .n + 1
    fi
fi

task main()
    flex t = (1, P { n: 1 })
    t.1.inc()
fi
